154
00:10:21,350 --> 00:10:23,850
Vocabulary for labeling a map questions.

155
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:31,560
We should grasp the basic vocabulary as follows.

156
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:35,540
Let's start with the first group, compass directions.

157
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:44,760
North, South, East, West, Northeast, Northwest, Southeast, Southwest.

158
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:48,840
The second group is general vocabulary of directions.

159
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:59,100
In the middle, center of, behind, between, next to, by, in front of, left-hand

160
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:06,600
side, right-hand side, turn right, to your right, pass through, on the other

161
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:10,700
side, behind, along, and corner.

162
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:14,020
Some collocations in giving directions.

163
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:21,120
To the north, to the south, in the northeast, in the southwest, north side,

164
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:27,180
east side, west side, south side, heading east, slightly west of, just

165
00:11:27,180 --> 00:11:28,140
southeast of.

